# Raw scraped snapshots of non-open-licensed sources stay local (see data/sources.json
# for URL, fetch date and hash of every snapshot). OSM extracts (ODbL) and the elevation tiles
# (LINZ, CC BY 3.0 NZ) are committed.
data/raw/*
!data/raw/osm/
!data/raw/terrain/
!data/raw/README.md

